--- disjointes ou non
F: 
E: 
X: 
énumération: 
S (int, string): {i s}
Sh (scalaire, liste): {circle rect}
M (var : prudent): {a b} {a s} {b s}
pas une somme: ERREUR type is {disjoint?}: pt is not a sum
--- l'avertissement (une somme qui se recouvre, sans option)
warning: type def W: variants i and d can take the same value (type is {disjoint?}W); write {-deduce}W to keep the deduction, or {-strict}W
sans option: 0
disjointe : rien: 0
--- {-deduce} : la plus stricte gagne
5: S.i
abc: S.s
strict?: 0
--- {-strict} : nommer la variante
strict?: 1
valeur nue: ERREUR value "5" names no variant of the strict sum T: write {i:}value or {T.i}value
{i:}5: T.i
{T.s}5: T.s
type {T.i}5: T.i
type cast T.i 5: T.i
type cast T 5: ERREUR value "5" names no variant of the strict sum T: write {i:}value or {T.i}value
liste, étiquettes: T.i T.s
liste, nu: ERREUR value "1" names no variant of the strict sum T: write {i:}value or {T.i}value
variable : la variante reste: T.s
valeur déjà typée: T.i
littéral : nommé par sa valeur: U
variante typée nue: ERREUR value "4" names no variant of the strict sum U: write {n:}value or {U.n}value
--- options
{-compact,-strict}: ERREUR type def {-strict}C: only a sum has a variant to choose
{-strict,-deduce}: ERREUR type def: {-strict} and {-deduce} exclude each other
{-strict} sur une liste: ERREUR type def {-strict}Z: only a sum has a variant to choose
sous-option: ERREUR type def: option {-strict} takes no sub-option or value: {-strict.niveau=1}
inconnue: ERREUR type def: unknown option {-bof}: must be {-compact}, {-strict} or {-deduce} (several: {-compact,-strict})
{-compact,-compact}: 1
alias: ERREUR type alias: unknown option {-strict} (an alias is not a new type: it takes no option)
question inconnue: ERREUR unknown question "zz?": must be compact?, disjoint? or strict?
